# Sync Demo: checks ic10-link between the editor and the game.
# db Setting: VERSION. Change it and save; the housing shows the new number once sent.
# d0: a lever (optional). d1: a light (optional), on while the lever is. From VSCode
define VERSION 1
alias Lever d0
alias Light d1
alias on r0

start:
yield
s db Setting VERSION
bdns Lever start
l on Lever Open
bdns Light start
s Light On on
j start
